  "item_short_desc": "<p>Introducing Rothco&rsquo;s 3-Layer Face Mask&mdash;an epitome of comfort, functionality, and everyday convenience. Crafted with a soft and stretchy polyester construction, this washable and reusable face mask is designed for your daily activities. The 3-layer design ensures flexibility and a comfortable fit, enhanced by the adjustable nose bridge that contours to the shape of your face. Ear loops on each end secure the mask in place, offering reliable protection without sacrificing comfort.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "132994",
  "description": "<p>Introducing Rothco&rsquo;s 3-Layer Face Mask&mdash;an epitome of comfort, functionality, and everyday convenience. Crafted with a soft and stretchy polyester construction, this washable and reusable face mask is designed for your daily activities. The 3-layer design ensures flexibility and a comfortable fit, enhanced by the adjustable nose bridge that contours to the shape of your face. Ear loops on each end secure the mask in place, offering reliable protection without sacrificing comfort. Measuring 7 inches wide by 5 inches high (3 &frac14; inches at the sides), Rothco's face mask provides ample coverage. Available in two sizes&mdash;SM/MD and LG/XL&mdash;the mask spans from ear loop to ear loop for a customized fit, ensuring comfort extended but not stretched. While Rothco's face masks are a practical addition to your everyday essentials, it's essential to note that these are not med-prep-grade surgical masks or N95 respirator masks. Rothco makes no claims regarding the prevention of infection or transmission of viruses or diseases. Choose Rothco for comfort, reliability, and responsible protection in your daily life.</p>",
